title: "New Paper with Danielle Daidone Published in the Canadian Journal of Applied Linguistics"
---

My article <a href= "https://journals.lib.unb.ca/index.php/CJAL/article/view/35877" target= "_blank"> Student attitudes towards high variability phonetic training in Spanish phonetics courses </a>, co-authored with <a href="https://www.ddaidone.com/" target= "_blank" >Danielle Daidone</a>, has been published in the Canadian Journal of Applied Linguistics.

In this paper we describe how we incorporated HVPT as online homework into upper-level Spanish pronunciation classes and collected students’ attitudes towards these tasks.
